---
/**
 * The reservation's left column: band two of the sheet — the solid blue with
 * the statement knocked out to the stock, the facts sitting beside it.
 */
---

<div
  class="reserve-band grain band-ink flex flex-col gap-8 p-8 md:p-10 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:col-span-5"
>
  <h2
    class="font-display text-[clamp(2.25rem,4vw+0.5rem,3.75rem)] leading-[0.98] font-extrabold text-paper"
  >
    Secure your hearth
  </h2>
  <p class="max-w-lg font-body text-base text-paper italic md:text-lg">
    The woodfire tandoors burn daily, fueled by premium hardwood coals. Seating is strictly limited
    to ensure individual culinary pacing.
  </p>

  <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-body text-sm text-paper md:text-[15px]">
    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Direct view of the live tandoor and sigree hearths</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Pitmaster selection tasting notes included</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Exclusive clay oven kitchen tour access post-meal</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
